{"seq":3,"slug":"rope","title":"绳索","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rope-constraint","title":"绳索约束：把玩家钉在一个球面上","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/rope-constraint","wordCount":1510,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"swing-physics","title":"摆荡物理：单摆、能量与那一下「甩出去」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/swing-physics","wordCount":1498,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"reel-in-out","title":"卷收与放绳：让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/reel-in-out","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"绳索\">绳索</h1><p>钩子咬住的那一瞬，物理内核才真正启动。绳子把玩家和一个固定锚点绑在一起，从此玩家的每一帧运动都要服从这根绳的约束——不能拉得比绳长更远、荡起来要像单摆、想上想下要靠卷收放绳。这一章是全 hub 数学最密的部分，也是决定「荡起来爽不爽」的地方。</p>\n<p>「绳索约束」讲最底层的距离约束：如何用一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|\\vec{p}-\\vec{a}\\| \\le L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的硬约束把玩家钉在球面内，Verlet 与 Position-Based Dynamics 如何在一步内投影修正、如何让绳子绕过棱角分段——通用约束求解借鉴 <a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/constraint-systems\">02_game-physics</a> 与 <a href=\"../../cloth-soft-body-simulation/cloth/position-based-dynamics\">41_cloth-soft-body-simulation</a>，这里只讲抓钩要用的那一小块。「摆荡物理」把约束下的运动展开成单摆：切向速度、能量守恒、以及最关键的——松手瞬间动量如何被完整保留，这是所有高速抓钩「甩出去」快感的来源。「卷收与放绳」处理绳长本身随时间变化：绞盘式硬拉、弹簧式软拉、边荡边收的能量注入，以及附着期间的空中操控。</p>\n<p>三篇是「约束 → 约束下的运动 → 主动改变约束」的递进，务必顺序阅读，且都以「附着」一章交出的锚点为前提。这一章在 hub 中是物理心脏；「实践」一章的手感辅助与镜头，本质都是在给这颗心脏配一套让人类玩得舒服的外围。</p>\n"}